sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + DECISIONS 5 (one swamp-role SSH identity) and R3 (vault key names).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: node:ssh-access:converge<br/>{node: 12}
  Note over GW: Check the non-root account<br/>refuse root · ssh_account_invalid
  Note over GW: Reuse task if same digest<br/>target + 209 public key
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>bootstrap key as vault key name
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5133
  Note over SW: Read bootstrap identity<br/>vault.get · bootstrap key, Node 12
  SW->>N: Authorize the 209 key<br/>bootstrap key · authorized_keys
  SW->>N: Log in with the 209 key<br/>swamp-role identity · true
  alt login works
    N-->>SW: exit 0
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>ssh_access_ready: true
    Note over GW: Store ssh_access_digest<br/>NodeFootprint for Node 12
  else key not accepted
    N--xSW: Permission denied
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code, failed step
    Note over GW: Keep the old digest<br/>retry is a new task
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #OP
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
